{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sirius-4 is a space simulator that gives the player complete freedom of action. The game takes place in a galaxy created using a level generator, which makes each new game session unique. There are various independent groups operating in these open spaces: pirates, fanatics and supranational interstellar corporations. The player is given a unique opportunity to explore this vast and vibrant world. Every time going into space, the player will be able to feel the pulse of humanity: hear the routine radio conversations of pilots and encounter ships tracking their routes. All this creates a unique atmosphere of a free pilot's life. All this is Sirius-4.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2435030?t=1756876264","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2435030/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756876264","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2435030/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756876264","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2435030/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756876264","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sirius-4 is a space simulator that gives the player complete freedom of action. The game takes place in a galaxy created using a level generator, which makes each new game session unique. There are various independent groups operating in these open spaces: pirates, fanatics and supranational interstellar corporations. The player is given a unique opportunity to explore this vast and vibrant world. Every time going into space, the player will be able to feel the pulse of humanity: hear the routine radio conversations of pilots and encounter ships tracking their routes. All this creates a unique atmosphere of a free pilot's life. All this is Sirius-4.</p>